  "projects": [
   {
    "title": "Registration Application for Charity Fishing Tournament",
    "description": "This Application is the online Registration for a charity fishing tournament. This program allows entrants in the tournament to register and pay online using the PayPal api. This registration app ties together with the Weigh In application in order to enter the Registrants fish in to the tournament. \n\nIt is a basic form that gathers the required information for each participant and submits the user information to a database. The user is then directed to PayPal for payment using PayPal or a Credit Card of their choice.\n\nI designed and coded this program as charity work for the charity fishing tournament.\n",
    "dateRange": {},
    "associatedWith": "Jun 2013 - Present"
   },
   {
    "title": "Weigh In Application for Charity Fishing Tournament",
    "description": "This App allows for the weigh master(s) at the fishing rodeo to easily enter and track the fish that are weighed in the tournament and display the winner of each category. The user simply selects from a list of Categories then Species associated with that Category. Then the Registrant is selected and the weight of the fish is input then submitted. The results are stored in a database and returned the the page for easy reference as to who is winning each Category.\n\nThe program has made the weigh in process much more efficient and simple and has saved a bunch of time in the process. \n\nI designed and wrote this app as charity for the charity fishing tournament and it ties in with the Online Registration app to make the entire Registration to Weigh In process much more efficient and less error prone.",
    "dateRange": {},
    "associatedWith": "Jun 2013 - Present"
   }
